  "ruleText": "He-P 4001.08 Communications. All communications and reports concerning these rules, and applications, or electronic submissions filed thereunder, shall be addressed to:\n\nRadiological Health Section\n\nDivision of Public Health Services\n\nNH Department of Health and Human Services\n\n29 Hazen Drive\n\nConcord, New Hampshire 03301\n\nSource. #5903, eff 2-1-95; ss by #6827, eff 8-6-98; ss and moved by #8488, eff 11-18-05 (from He-P 4001.07); ss by #8808, eff 1-24-07; ss by #10805, eff 3-28-15; ss by #13120, eff 10-20-20",
